A deep learning-based machine learning potential for accurate and efficient simulations of amino acid dipeptides, trained using the DeePMD-kit framework with DFT reference data from ABACUS.

This model is a DeepMD potential trained on all 20 standard amino acid dipeptides (Ace-X-NMe) across diverse backbone conformations. The model achieves near-chemical accuracy while providing ~1000× speedup compared to DFT calculations.


[The Github link](https://github.com/raphaelobinna/DeepMd-Amini-Acid-Model)